      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ISHIKAWA LASS (1) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten 3.5 lengths into second (22.55) at Warrnambool in a Grade 4/5 over 390m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to feature in the finish again. TOP KADE (3) recorded one of the quickest times on the card this course and distance last time, finishing second in a Grade 4/5 in 19.90 and a new PB here. Strong run latest and looks a key chance on that form. SOPHIE BANJO (6) has a strong overall record having five wins and four places from 12 starts including a last start third (19.58) over 350m at Healesville. Form at the trip sound including four wins. Rates a winning chance on best. CHARLIE'S ROSE (7) is on a run of two minor placings and is sure to play a big role again.",
